@startuml
title RentBuild | TB1 JavaScript — IAM
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam dpi 160
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
hide empty methods
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
class "SignInCommand" as SignInCommand {
  - String email
  - String password
  --
  + constructor(props)
  + email() String
  + password() String
}
class "SignUpCommand" as SignUpCommand {
  - String firstName
  - String lastName
  - String email
  - String password
  - String companyName
  - String role
  --
  + constructor(props)
  + email() String
  + role() String
}
class "IamStore" as IamStore {
  - IamApi api
  - Ref signedIn
  - Ref userId
  - Ref role
  - Number version
  --
  + signIn(command, router)
  + signUp(command, router)
  + signOut(router)
  + clearError()
}
class "IamApi" as IamApi {
  - SignInAdapter signInEndpoint
  - SignUpApiEndpoint signUpEndpoint
  --
  + signIn(command) Observable
  + signUp(command) Observable
}
IamStore "1" --> "1" IamApi : api resolved through services
IamStore ..> SignInCommand : accepts sign-in command
IamStore ..> SignUpCommand : accepts registration command
footer TB1 JAVASCRIPT — DEVELOP 7e862dd + PR17 c4c3452 (PENDING REVIEW); NO C# BACKEND CLAIM
@enduml
